"╭ ╭ Apply changes — shop.people ─────────────────────────────────────────────╮  "
"│ │ 1 update                                                                 │─╮"
"│▾│                                                                          │ │"
"│ │ Row checks (lock)                                                        │e│"
"│ │   SELECT 1 FROM `shop`.`people` WHERE `id` <=> 1 AND `name` =   expect 1 │ │"
"│ │     _utf8mb4 X'706C61696E206E616D65' AND CONVERT(`name` USING utf8mb4)   │ │"
"│ │     COLLATE utf8mb4_0900_bin <=> _utf8mb4 X'706C61696E206E616D65' AND    │ │"
"│ │     `note` = _utf8mb4 X'6F6C64' AND CONVERT(`note` USING utf8mb4)        │ │"
"│ │     COLLATE utf8mb4_0900_bin <=> _utf8mb4 X'6F6C64' FOR UPDATE           │ │"
"│ │     ↳ name = 'plain name', note = 'old'                                  │─╯"
"│ │ Writes                                                                   │─╮"
"│ │   UPDATE `shop`.`people` SET `note` = _utf8mb4 X'615C62' WHERE  expect 1 │ │"
"│ │     `id` <=> 1 AND `name` = _utf8mb4 X'706C61696E206E616D65' AND         │ │"
"│ │     CONVERT(`name` USING utf8mb4) COLLATE utf8mb4_0900_bin <=> _utf8mb4  │ │"
"│ │     X'706C61696E206E616D65' AND `note` = _utf8mb4 X'6F6C64' AND          │ │"
"│ │     CONVERT(`note` USING utf8mb4) COLLATE utf8mb4_0900_bin <=> _utf8mb4  │ │"
"│ │     X'6F6C64'                                                            │ │"
"│ │     ↳ note = 'a\b', name = 'plain name', note = 'old'                    │ │"
"│ │                                                                          │ │"
"│ │ Runs in one transaction; commits at the end.                             │ │"
"│ │                                                                          │ │"
"│ │                  [ Cancel ]     Copy SQL       Apply                     │ │"
"╰─╰─────────────────── y apply · c copy SQL · j/k scroll · Enter/Esc cancel ─╯─╯"
